        "text_YYjgFV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Erika Estrada began her journey with NADCO in the finishing department, where she quickly developed a strong understanding of the company’s operations. Her career progressed through various roles, including positions in converting and the press department, allowing her to build a comprehensive skill set across different aspects of production. For the past 10 years, Erika has served as a production manager, where she thrives on the dynamic challenges each day brings.</p><p>Working in a fully custom facility, Erika is passionate about the process of analyzing each job from start to finish. She enjoys the puzzle of determining how to best approach each project, ensuring that every task is handled with precision to achieve the desired end product. Her ability to think critically and adapt to the unique needs of each job has made her a valuable asset to the team.</p><p>Outside of work, Erika enjoys family life with her husband, who is also a valued NADCO employee, and their two daughters. Together, they balance their careers and family life, all while embracing the challenges and rewards that come with both.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
